&reftitle.description;

 arraystream_get_filters



 Retrieve the list of registered filters on the running system.

&reftitle.examples;
Using stream_get_filters
<?php $filters = stream_get_filters(); print_r($filters);
&example.outputs.similar;
Array ( [0] => zlib.* [1] => convert.iconv.* [2] => string.rot13 [3] => string.toupper [4] => string.tolower [5] => convert.* [6] => consumed [7] => dechunk )
